    <ferc:DisclosureOfSubsequentEventsTextBlock id="f-314" contextRef="c-09">&lt;p style="text-align: left"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, GeezaPro, &amp;quot;DejaVu Serif&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); display: inline !important; float: none"&gt;On January 26, 2026, the Respondent entered into a purchase and sale agreement with Eiger Operating Company to sell the WTG Hugoton Pipeline for an estimated sales price of $2 million. The sale closed on April 30, 2026 with an effective date of January 1, 2026.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfSubsequentEventsTextBlock>
